{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this bat wants to do is eat! It will fly, climb, and screech it's way through any challenge to find it's stolen fruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megabat</strong> is a pixel art 2D &quot;Batformer&quot; (platformer) passion project  with an emphasis on eating different fruit to gain abilities to enhance your movement!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but brutal platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ punishing levels to fly and screech your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets await for those seeking an even greater challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bat can wear hats... because why not</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLY, CLIMB, SCREECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/b77af9cd1047afdd90d4ffd024a5083d.poster.avif?t=1762762444\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/b77af9cd1047afdd90d4ffd024a5083d.webm?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/b77af9cd1047afdd90d4ffd024a5083d.mp4?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER UP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's more than just dashing but you got to have a dash because it's fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/5980c40ca7cf5a8296cf2d4003f54ac7.poster.avif?t=1762762444\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/5980c40ca7cf5a8296cf2d4003f54ac7.webm?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/5980c40ca7cf5a8296cf2d4003f54ac7.mp4?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEED AND CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're lacking a super powered fruit use the environment to speed yourself up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/9bfe9e0c35f74737d95eb13eb89fbbd6.poster.avif?t=1762762444\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/9bfe9e0c35f74737d95eb13eb89fbbd6.webm?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/9bfe9e0c35f74737d95eb13eb89fbbd6.mp4?t=1762762444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2429230?t=1762762444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762762444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/7c531cbfa3874b730a66a2bda81f94210da5a6ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762762444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/7c531cbfa3874b730a66a2bda81f94210da5a6ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762762444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Vo